    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118302
    m_Key: Hello, Farm!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118303
    m_Key: Flip two cards at a time and find the matching pairs of farm animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118304
    m_Key: Click a card to flip it, then find its twin!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118305
    m_Key: Barnyard Buddies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118306
    m_Key: Find pairs back to back to build a combo worth up to x5 points!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118307
    m_Key: Combos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118308
    m_Key: Matches in a row multiply your points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118309
    m_Key: Peek-a-Boo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118310
    m_Key: Every card shows its face before the round begins. Remember as many as you can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118311
    m_Key: Memorize
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118312
    m_Key: Watch closely while the cards are face up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118313
    m_Key: Race the Rooster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118314
    m_Key: Beat the clock before the rooster crows! Every pair you find adds two seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118315
    m_Key: Time attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118316
    m_Key: The clock is ticking - every match buys you time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118317
    m_Key: Tick-Tock Barn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118318
    m_Key: Clock cards hide among the animals. Flip one for six extra seconds!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118319
    m_Key: Clock cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118320
    m_Key: Clock cards give you extra time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118321
    m_Key: Hen Party
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118322
    m_Key: Five hearts, and every mistake costs one. Can you keep them all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118323
    m_Key: Survival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118324
    m_Key: Every mistake costs a heart - think before you flip!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118325
    m_Key: Welcome to the Jungle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118326
    m_Key: The rainbow wild card matches any animal - and finds its twin for you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118327
    m_Key: Wild card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118328
    m_Key: Flip the wild card together with any animal to match all of its kind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118329
    m_Key: Monkey Business
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118330
    m_Key: Cheeky monkeys! After every third mistake the hidden cards swap places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118331
    m_Key: Shuffle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118332
    m_Key: Three mistakes and the monkeys shuffle the hidden cards!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118333
    m_Key: Snake Pit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118334
    m_Key: Two bombs hide in the pit. Each one costs a heart - remember where they are!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118335
    m_Key: Bombs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118336
    m_Key: Bombs cost a heart. Once you have seen one, stay away from it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118337
    m_Key: Parrot Parade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118338
    m_Key: The parrots want a parade! Match the animals in the order shown at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118339
    m_Key: Parade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118340
    m_Key: Only the animal the parade asks for counts. Remember the others for later!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118341
    m_Key: Triple Trouble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118342
    m_Key: Everything comes in threes here. Find three of a kind to make a match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118343
    m_Key: Triplets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118344
    m_Key: Flip three matching cards to make a set.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118345
    m_Key: Jungle Rumble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118346
    m_Key: Bombs, a wild card, a clock and shuffles, all against the clock. Rumble in the jungle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118347
    m_Key: Use the wild card on the animal you cannot find.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118348
    m_Key: Thin Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118349
    m_Key: Frozen cards need a tap to crack the ice before they will flip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118350
    m_Key: Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118351
    m_Key: Tap a frozen card once to crack the ice, then again to flip it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118352
    m_Key: Penguin Waddle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118353
    m_Key: 'Waddle wisely: you only have 26 moves. Peek cards show the whole board for a moment.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118354
    m_Key: Moves and peeks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118355
    m_Key: Peek cards reveal every hidden card for a moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118356
    m_Key: Whale Songs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118357
    m_Key: Triplets against the clock. Sing along and find three of a kind!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118358
    m_Key: Every set of three adds three seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118359
    m_Key: Blizzard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118360
    m_Key: A blizzard blows the cards around after every second mistake - and some are frozen solid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118361
    m_Key: Two mistakes and the blizzard shuffles the hidden cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118362
    m_Key: Polar Parade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118363
    m_Key: 'A parade on thin ice: match in order and steer clear of the bombs.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118364
    m_Key: The parade shows the next animals at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118365
    m_Key: Aurora Finale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118366
    m_Key: The grand finale under the northern lights. Every twist you have learned, all at once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118367
    m_Key: Save the peek card for when the board is full of question marks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118368
    m_Key: Endless Carnival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118369
    m_Key: Clear board after board before the clock runs out. Every cleared board adds time, and new twists join the fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118370
    m_Key: Free Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584118371
    m_Key: 'Deal a board with your own rules: open Settings to choose the size, the timer, hearts, moves and special cards.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
